                                        "entry_id": "04118636-a70a-34b2-817c-04dba89e8c66",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of a class of polycyclic heterocycles that are responsible for the bioluminescence of fireflies, being converted to oxyluciferin by luciferase in the process."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1fd1d462-bf29-4d5a-b4fc-b4e94427ae80",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5cc6e6-2a59-3245-81c6-9e62ca719c24",
                                                "text": "Aptly enough, glowworms light up their underworld with a pair of chemicals that have a satanic etymology—luciferins and luciferases, after the Latin for “light bringer.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
